    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Too Many Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some games have enemy waves. This game has enemy tsunamis. The undead come in overwhelming numbers, flooding the screen. Survival is possible, but chances are slim.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/f4aab962590d90f49e278ba177c4d221.poster.avif?t=1741772345\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/f4aab962590d90f49e278ba177c4d221.webm?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/f4aab962590d90f49e278ba177c4d221.mp4?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Mining</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between major battles, you explore procedurally generated mines for gold and upgrades. But it's no time for relaxation, there's undead here too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/93f464b0ee846fc8df38d61e39914b63.poster.avif?t=1741772345\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/93f464b0ee846fc8df38d61e39914b63.webm?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/93f464b0ee846fc8df38d61e39914b63.mp4?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Objective</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough to defeat the Evil Skullhead and put an end to his mockery forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/ca6497791326a2bd2295ff7fbd4926ab.poster.avif?t=1741772345\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/ca6497791326a2bd2295ff7fbd4926ab.webm?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/ca6497791326a2bd2295ff7fbd4926ab.mp4?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Too Many Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some games have enemy waves. This game has enemy tsunamis. The undead come in overwhelming numbers, flooding the screen. Survival is possible, but chances are slim.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/f4aab962590d90f49e278ba177c4d221.poster.avif?t=1741772345\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/f4aab962590d90f49e278ba177c4d221.webm?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/f4aab962590d90f49e278ba177c4d221.mp4?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Mining</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between major battles, you explore procedurally generated mines for gold and upgrades. But it's no time for relaxation, there's undead here too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/93f464b0ee846fc8df38d61e39914b63.poster.avif?t=1741772345\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/93f464b0ee846fc8df38d61e39914b63.webm?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/93f464b0ee846fc8df38d61e39914b63.mp4?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Objective</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough to defeat the Evil Skullhead and put an end to his mockery forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/ca6497791326a2bd2295ff7fbd4926ab.poster.avif?t=1741772345\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/ca6497791326a2bd2295ff7fbd4926ab.webm?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566790/extras/ca6497791326a2bd2295ff7fbd4926ab.mp4?t=1741772345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
